<% content_for :sidebar do %>
  <div class="sidebar-stack">
    <%= link_to "Back Home", "/achievements/", class: "sidebar-button" %>
  </div>
<% end %>

<section class="chain-index">
  <header class="chain-index__header">
    <p class="eyebrow">Help</p>
    <h1>About Achievement Chains</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="chain-card">
    <p>
      One day I stepped out of the shower and I realised that I had this idea to make a project called "Achievement Chains", so here it is.
    </p>
    <p>
      The idea is that everyone can make their own chains and share with others. Then others can favorite/follow/add to their library and track their progress.
    </p>
    <p>
      On another day when I already had a big part of this project done, I wrote about it:
    </p>
    <p>
      I want to build something about making achievements into meaningful journeys for someone who doesn't know where to start with a game. Or did the main story and doesn't know what to do next.
    </p>
    <p>
      And who am I? I'm just someone who is addicted to steam achievements... My profile is here: <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199079570785/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199079570785/</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
